OL,5,G0232 Tech Life
OL,6,     FThe nose of a dog is incredibly
OL,7,     Fsensitive. And odour contains
OL,8,     Finformation. With the help of AI,
OL,9,     Felectronic 'noses' are being used
OL,10,     Fto sniff out complex odours,
OL,11,     Fincluding diseases.
OL,12,G0300 BBC News
OL,13,     FThe latest five minute news
OL,14,     Fbulletin from BBC World Service.
OL,15,G0306 Outlook
OL,16,     FSociologist Liu Jieyu set out to
OL,17,     Funderstand three generations of
OL,18,     FChinese families. She spoke to
OL,19,     Fhundreds of people about marriage,
OL,20,     Fin-laws, children - and secret
OL,21,     Flove affairs.
