OL,5,G0432 Heart and Soul
OL,6,     FWhen Rimi Tanaka's mother died,
OL,7,     Fshe was writing a book about her
OL,8,     Fsamurai ancestry. Rimi sets out to
OL,9,     Ffinish it hoping to get closer to
OL,10,     Fthe Japanese mother she never
OL,11,     Freally knew.
